{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cism_velo",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the pointwise laws of the CISM DIVA velocity solve (stage 2 of the EqESM project; CISM = cismwrap_3_00_002 / cism_main_3.00.002 as built in CESM cesm3.0-alphabranch, reference run T1850Gg/f09_g17_gris20, which_ho_approx = HO_APPROX_DIVA = 4, which_ho_gradient = 0, margin = 1, assemble_taud = 1, diva_slope_correction = .true., which_ho_babc = 3, max_slope = 0.5, thck_gradient_ramp = 50 m, thklim = 1 m, upn = 11, nquad = 4): three pointwise components covering the DIVA column laws of glissade_velo_higher_solve, leaving the 2-D finite-element matrix solve, the vertex staggers, and the Picard iteration itself to the stage-3 assembly (stage2/README-cism-velo.md): (a) DivaGeometry - the vertex geometry of the driving stress and the slope correction: the hybrid-margin surface gradient dusrf_dx/dy of the NE-corner vertex from the four-cell stencil (glissade_grid_operators.F90 surface_elevation_gradient, HO_GRADIENT_MARGIN_HYBRID, F90:999-1079, with the max_slope clamp F90:1234-1252), the 4-cell mean staggered thickness stagthck, the driving stress taudx = -rhoi*grav*stagthck*dusrf_dx (load_vector_gravity, HO_ASSEMBLE_TAUD_LOCAL, F90:4353-4384), the slope angle of the DIVA correction theta_x = atan(|dz_dx|) from the PLAIN vertex gradient of z_mean = usrf - thck/2 (glissade_slope_angle_staggered, F90:1510, with slope_mask = 1 everywhere) and the slope factor F = cos^2(theta) + 4 sin^2(theta) (F90:2189-2193), plus the bwat = 0 effective-pressure identity effecpress_stag = rhoi*g*stagthck pinned at the same stencil; (b) DivaIntegrals - the Goldberg (2011) vertical integrals of the sigma column (compute_integrals_diva, F90:5570-5696): omega_k as the interface-to-bed cumulative integral of sig_mid*thck*(mean over the nquad quadrature points of 1/efvs_qp) and omega as the trapezoid sigma integral of omega_k (no thck factor), both written as ESD integral operators lowered by the local EarthSciDiscretizations-format rules of ./cism_velo_discretization.esm (the imported column_nonuniform_1d rules integral_lev_nodes_cumulative_to_top and integral_lev_whole, the exact stencil of the Fortran loops), with the cell-centered efvs (the arithmetic mean of the quad-point viscosities, F90:5266-5272; the Fortran computes the integral at each quad point and averages, NOT the integral of the averaged viscosity, F90:5578-5583), the staggered stag_omega (the 4-cell mean of omega with stagger_margin = 1; the other three cells' omega enter as inputs because only the traced cell's efvs_q is dumped), and the active-cell guard (the whole block sits inside the active_cell test of the element loop, F90:5091: ice-free cells keep efvs = omega_k = omega = 0 even when the dumped efvs_q inputs are stale nonzero values from a previous step); (c) DivaVelocity - the basal friction, traction and 3-D recovery chain: the pseudo-plastic beta of the mounted BasalTraction (./cism_basal.esm, which_ho_babc = 3) evaluated at the basal velocity, beta_internal = f_ground*beta (the calcbeta f_ground weighting, glissade_basal_traction.F90:595-630; f_ground = 1 on every traced row), the effective basal friction beta_eff = F*beta/(F + beta*omega*cos(theta)) (F90:2589-2601, Goldberg 2011 eq. 40-41 with the May 2025 slope correction), the basal traction btractx = beta_internal*uvel_basal (= beta_eff*uvel_2d, F90:3874, 5780), the basal-velocity recovery uvel_basal = uvel_2d*beta_eff/beta_internal (Goldberg eq. 34, F90:5800-5801) and the 3-D velocity profile uvel[k] = uvel_basal + btractx*stag_omega_k[k]*cos(theta)/F (Goldberg eq. 32 with the slope correction, F90:5935-5936). Deferred to stage 3 (documented in stage2/README-cism-velo.md): the 2-D finite-element assembly and the Picard iteration of the solve itself, the per-level stagger of omega_k to the vertex (stag_omega_k enters as a dumped input), the effective-pressure cell-to-vertex stagger (N_stag enters as a dumped input; the effecpress_stag = rhoi*g*stagthck identity of the bwat = 0 run is pinned in the DivaGeometry tests), and the accel_picard accepted-pass restore: the dumped beta_internal is the last ACCEPTED calcbeta pass, whose velocity iterate differs from the exit basal velocity by the final Picard correction, so the beta chain (BasalTraction at the exit basal velocity) is pinned at rel 1e-5 - worst 6.04e-7 over the 128 exit rows, a stated numerical reason for the tolerance; every other law is pinned at rel 1e-12 (worst verified 6.6e-13, the dusrf_dx dump round-trip). Tests pin the laws against the cism_velo.csv / cism_velo_nbr.csv exit rows (4 steps x 32 traced cells, solver-internal m/yr and Pa yr units; scale_output has not yet run).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "eqesm:stage2",
   "model:velocity",
   "grid:cism_sigma_column"
  ],
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "CISM (Community Ice Sheet Model) cism_main_3.00.002, libglissade/glissade_velo_higher.F90 (glissade_velo_higher_solve, compute_integrals_diva, compute_3d_velocity_diva, load_vector_gravity) and libglissade/glissade_grid_operators.F90 (surface_elevation_gradient, glissade_slope_angle_staggered)."
   },
   {
    "citation": "Goldberg, D. N. (2011). A variationally derived, depth-integrated approximation for a full-Stokes ice sheet model. Journal of Glaciology, 57(204), 717-728."
   }
  ]
 },
 "models": {
  "DivaGeometry": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cism_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "usrf_sw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "surface elevation of the SW stencil cell (the traced cell; cism_velo_nbr.csv usrf_sw), m"
    },
    "usrf_se": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "surface elevation of the SE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv usrf_se), m"
    },
    "usrf_nw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "surface elevation of the NW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv usrf_nw), m"
    },
    "usrf_ne": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "surface elevation of the NE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv usrf_ne), m"
    },
    "thck_sw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice thickness of the SW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv thck_sw), m"
    },
    "thck_se": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice thickness of the SE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv thck_se), m"
    },
    "thck_nw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice thickness of the NW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv thck_nw), m"
    },
    "thck_ne": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice thickness of the NE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv thck_ne), m"
    },
    "ice_mask_sw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice mask of the SW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv ice_mask_sw): 1 where thck > thklim"
    },
    "ice_mask_se": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice mask of the SE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv ice_mask_se)"
    },
    "ice_mask_nw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice mask of the NW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv ice_mask_nw)"
    },
    "ice_mask_ne": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice mask of the NE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv ice_mask_ne)"
    },
    "land_mask_sw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "land mask of the SW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv land_mask_sw): 1 on land, 0 on ocean"
    },
    "land_mask_se": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "land mask of the SE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv land_mask_se)"
    },
    "land_mask_nw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "land mask of the NW stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv land_mask_nw)"
    },
    "land_mask_ne": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "land mask of the NE stencil cell (cism_velo_nbr.csv land_mask_ne)"
    },
    "thklim": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "ice thickness limit ice_limit (glide_types.F90 default 1.0 m): cells with thck <= thklim are ice-free; the hybrid-margin ramp starts at this thickness"
    },
    "ramp": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 50.0,
     "description": "thck_gradient_ramp (glide_types.F90:2395 default 50.0 m): the distance over which the hybrid-margin edge factor ramps from 0 to 1"
    },
    "max_slope": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.5,
     "description": "max_slope (glide_types.F90 default 0.5): the clamp of the driving-stress surface gradient (grid_operators.F90:1234-1252)"
    },
    "dx": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 20000.0,
     "description": "grid spacing (gris20 dx = dy = 20 km; the reference run is square, dx = dy)"
    },
    "rhoi": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "default": 917.0,
     "description": "ice density (glide_types default 917.0 kg/m3)"
    },
    "g": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "default": 9.80616,
     "description": "gravitational acceleration (glide_types default 9.80616 m/s2)"
    },
    "z_mean_sw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "z_mean = usrf - thck/2 = 0.5*(usrf + lsrf) of the SW stencil cell, the mid-ice elevation whose gradient feeds the DIVA slope angle (glissade_velo_higher.F90:2160; lsrf = topg - eus and usrf = lsrf + thck, so z_mean = usrf - thck/2)"
    },
    "z_mean_se": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "z_mean of the SE stencil cell"
    },
    "z_mean_nw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "z_mean of the NW stencil cell"
    },
    "z_mean_ne": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "z_mean of the NE stencil cell"
    },
    "edge_s": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "hybrid-margin surface gradient d(usrf)/dx on the SOUTH edge of the vertex (between the SW and SE cells; cism_hybrid_edge_gradient, grid_operators.F90:999-1079)"
    },
    "edge_n": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "hybrid-margin surface gradient d(usrf)/dx on the NORTH edge of the vertex (between the NW and NE cells)"
    },
    "edge_w": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "hybrid-margin surface gradient d(usrf)/dy on the WEST edge of the vertex (between the SW and NW cells)"
    },
    "edge_e": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "hybrid-margin surface gradient d(usrf)/dy on the EAST edge of the vertex (between the SE and NE cells)"
    },
    "dusrf_dx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "surface elevation gradient at the vertex used for the driving stress: the centered average of the south/north hybrid edge gradients, clamped to +/-max_slope (the dumped dusrf_dx column)"
    },
    "dusrf_dy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "surface elevation gradient at the vertex in y: the centered average of the west/east hybrid edge gradients, clamped to +/-max_slope (the dumped dusrf_dy column)"
    },
    "dz_dx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "x-gradient of z_mean at the vertex from the PLAIN centered vertex gradient (no hybrid masking, no clamp: the glissade_gradient construction used by the slope angle, F90:1510, with slope_mask = 1 everywhere)"
    },
    "dz_dy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "y-gradient of z_mean at the vertex (plain centered vertex gradient)"
    },
    "theta_x": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "rad",
     "description": "x-direction surface slope angle of the DIVA slope correction: theta_x = atan(|dz_dx|) (cism_theta_slope_x, grid_operators.F90:1510; the dumped stag_theta_slope_x column)"
    },
    "theta_y": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "rad",
     "description": "y-direction surface slope angle of the DIVA slope correction: theta_y = atan(|dz_dy|) (the dumped stag_theta_slope_y column)"
    },
    "F_x": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "DIVA slope correction factor in x: F_x = cos^2(theta_x) + 4 sin^2(theta_x) (cism_diva_slope_factor, F90:2189-2193; the dumped stag_diva_slope_factor_x column)"
    },
    "F_y": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "DIVA slope correction factor in y: F_y = cos^2(theta_y) + 4 sin^2(theta_y) (the dumped stag_diva_slope_factor_y column)"
    },
    "stagthck": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "staggered ice thickness at the vertex: the plain 4-cell mean of thck (glissade_stagger, stagger_margin = 0, grid_operators.F90:125-133; the dumped stagthck column)"
    },
    "taudx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "x driving stress at the vertex: taudx = -rhoi*grav*stagthck*dusrf_dx (cism_driving_stress, load_vector_gravity, HO_ASSEMBLE_TAUD_LOCAL, F90:4353-4384; the dumped taudx column)"
    },
    "taudy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "y driving stress at the vertex: taudy = -rhoi*grav*stagthck*dusrf_dy (the dumped taudy column)"
    }
   },
